id":"yph_dkb_w4w","status":"contextual_provisional","note":"本段丞相主語為申屠嘉；不標丞相府的建築詞，也不將擬授職位當現任者。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-096-zhang","book_id":"b-shiji-096","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-096-zhang"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:p001","text":"諺曰「力田不如逢年，善仕不如遇合」，固無虛言。非獨女以色媚，而士宦亦有之。昔以色幸者多矣。至漢興，高祖至暴抗也，然籍孺以佞幸；孝惠時有閎孺。此兩人非有材能，徒以婉佞貴幸，與上臥起，公卿皆因關說。故孝惠時郎侍中皆冠鵕䴊，貝帶，傅脂粉，化閎、籍之屬也。兩人徙家安陵。孝文時中寵臣，士人則鄧通，宦者則趙同、北宮伯子。北宮伯子以愛人長者；而趙同以星氣幸，常為文帝參乘；鄧通無伎能。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m001-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m001-0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"籍孺","kind":"person","person_id":"wbf_66x_6s2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m001-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"孝惠","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m001-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"閎孺","kind":"person","person_id":"nxn_szf_9gi","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m001-0085","start":85,"end":89,"surface":"與上臥起","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m001-0098","start":98,"end":100,"surface":"孝惠","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m001-0117","start":117,"end":118,"surface":"閎","kind":"person","person_id":"nxn_szf_9gi","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m001-0119","start":119,"end":120,"surface":"籍","kind":"person","person_id":"wbf_66x_6s2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m001-0131","start":131,"end":133,"surface":"孝文","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m001-0141","start":141,"end":143,"surface":"鄧通","kind":"person","person_id":"qow_wy0_7d2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m001-0147","start":147,"end":149,"surface":"趙同","kind":"person","person_id":"qyn_07y_0gt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m001-0150","start":150,"end":154,"surface":"北宮伯子","kind":"person","person_id":"1nq_eoh_8y0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m001-0155","start":155,"end":159,"surface":"北宮伯子","kind":"person","person_id":"1nq_eoh_8y0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m001-0166","start":166,"end":168,"surface":"趙同","kind":"person","person_id":"qyn_07y_0gt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m001-0175","start":175,"end":177,"surface":"文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m001-0180","start":180,"end":182,"surface":"鄧通","kind":"person","person_id":"qow_wy0_7d2","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing","book_id":"b-shiji-125","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji125-ningxing"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:p002","text":"鄧通，蜀郡南安人也，以濯舩為黃頭郎。孝文帝夢欲上天，不能，有一黃頭郎從後推之上天，顧見其衣裻帶后穿。覺而之漸臺，以夢中陰目求推者郎，即見鄧通，其衣后穿，夢中所見也。召問其名姓，姓鄧氏，名通，文帝說焉，尊幸之日異。通亦願謹，不好外交，雖賜洗沐，不欲出。於是文帝賞賜通巨萬以十數，官至上大夫。文帝時時如鄧通家遊戲。然鄧通無他能，不能有所薦士，獨自謹其身以媚上而已。上使善相者相通，曰「當貧餓死」。文帝曰：「能富通者在我也。何謂貧乎？」於是賜鄧通蜀嚴道銅山，得自鑄錢，「鄧氏錢」布天下。其富如此。文帝嘗病癰，鄧通常為帝唶吮之。文帝不樂，從容問通曰：「天下誰最愛我者乎？」通曰：「宜莫如太子。」太子入問病，文帝使唶癰，唶癰而色難之。已而聞鄧通常為帝唶吮之，心慚，由此怨通矣。及文帝崩，景帝立，鄧通免，家居。居無何，人有告鄧通盜出徼外鑄錢。下吏驗問，頗有之，遂竟案，盡沒入鄧通家，尚負責數巨萬。長公主賜鄧通，吏輒隨沒入之，一簪不得著身。於是長公主乃令假衣食。竟不得名一錢，寄死人家。孝景帝時，中無寵臣，然獨郎中令周文仁，仁寵最過庸，乃不甚篤。今天子中寵臣，士人則韓王孫嫣，宦者則李延年。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m002-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"鄧通","kind":"person","person_id":"qow_wy0_7d2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m002-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"孝文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-12